<LegalPage title="License" description="A plain-language summary of the Flicksy lifetime license." updated="September 3, 2026">
  <p>Your one-time Flicksy purchase includes permanent access to the app and every future update published for the Flicksy product. There is no subscription and no paid major-version upgrade planned for existing purchasers.</p>

  <h2>Direct purchase</h2>
  <p>A direct license may be active on up to three Macs. You can deactivate a Mac inside Flicksy to reuse that seat. Keep the license key private.</p>

  <h2>Mac App Store purchase</h2>
  <p>An App Store purchase is associated with the Apple Account used to buy it and can be restored through the app, subject to Apple’s store terms. Family Sharing is not enabled.</p>

  <h2>Separate sales channels</h2>
  <p>Direct and Mac App Store purchases are separate and cannot be activated or restored across stores. Switching builds preserves compatible Flicksy app data, but it does not transfer a purchase entitlement.</p>
</LegalPage>
